     aaccttiioonn "_c_o_m_m_a_n_d";
                Same as above.

     mmaattcchh "_v_a_r_i_a_b_l_e" "_v_a_l_u_e";
                Matches the content of _v_a_l_u_e against _v_a_r_i_a_b_l_e; the content of
