     The following sub-statements are supported within the nnoottiiffyy statement.
     The “notify” variable is available inside this statement and contains, a
     value, depending on which system and subsystem that delivered the event.

     aaccttiioonn "_c_o_m_m_a_n_d";
                Command to execute upon a successful match.  Example
                “/etc/rc.d/power_profile $notify”.

     mmaattcchh "_s_y_s_t_e_m | _s_u_b_s_y_s_t_e_m | _t_y_p_e | _n_o_t_i_f_y" "_v_a_l_u_e";
